# django-siteblocks

This is a fork of [django-siteblocks](https://github.com/jrief/django-siteblocks) that adds support for Django 1.11.

## Installation

```
pip install django-siteblocks
```

## Usage

### Settings

Add `siteblocks` to your `INSTALLED_APPS` setting.

```python
INSTALLED_APPS = (
   ...
   'siteblocks',
   ...
)
```

### Template Tags

#### `siteblock`

```html
{% load siteblocks %}

{% siteblock "myblock" %}
```

#### `siteblock_as`

```html
{% load siteblocks %}

{% siteblock "myblock" as myvar %}
```

#### `siteblock_exists`

```html
{% load siteblocks %}

{% if siteblock_exists "myblock" %}
```

#### `siteblock_empty`

```html
{% load siteblocks %}

{% if siteblock_empty "myblock" %}
```

#### `siteblock_not_empty`

```html
{% load siteblocks %}

{% if siteblock_not_empty "myblock" %}
```

### Template Context

#### `siteblocks`

```html
{% load siteblocks %}

{% for block in siteblocks %}
    {{ block.name }}
{% endfor %}
```

